01:55:12,064 --> 01:55:12,904
Like this?

2719
01:55:12,904 --> 01:55:21,064
Yeah, if we pick someone fainted, the timer will stop, but if you drop her down again, she will become ghost.
Yeah, if we pick someone who fainted, the timer will stop, but if you drop her down again, she will become a ghost.

2720
01:55:21,264 --> 01:55:22,224
なるほど！
I see!

2721
01:55:22,224 --> 01:55:24,584
持っていればいいってこと？
So as long as I hold her, it's fine?

2722
01:55:24,664 --> 01:55:25,944
そうそう。
Yeah, yeah.

2723
01:55:25,944 --> 01:55:27,704
持っていたら死なないっぽい。
It seems she won't die as long as I hold her.

2724
01:55:27,704 --> 01:55:29,184
Don't drop her.

2725
01:55:29,084 --> 01:55:31,144
Just a little bit more, just a little bit more.

2726
01:55:31,184 --> 01:55:33,664
I got you, Biboo-senpai!

2727
01:55:33,664 --> 01:55:35,104
Biboo-senpai!

2728
01:55:35,504 --> 01:55:39,864
Feed her a bit maybe. Any food, any berries, probably.

2729
01:55:39,984 --> 01:55:41,624
I have berries noja.
I have berries.

2730
01:55:41,664 --> 01:55:44,424
Okay, okay. Feed her, feed her.

2731
01:55:46,544 --> 01:55:49,064
あ、今キョーコだな。ちょっ、ウェイトウェイトウェイト！ビジュー先輩！
Ah, that was Kyoko just now. Wait, wait, wait! Biboo-senpai!

2732
01:55:49,064 --> 01:55:50,584
I can't!

2733
01:55:50,584 --> 01:55:51,704
No!

2734
01:55:51,704 --> 01:55:53,184
Okay, I'll feed her, I'll feed her.

2735
01:55:53,224 --> 01:55:54,184
はい！はい！あった！
Yes! Yes! Found it!

2736
01:55:58,144 --> 01:56:00,264
今キャリー、キャリーしちゃってる！
I'm carrying her, carrying her right now!

2737
01:56:00,264 --> 01:56:01,504
どうすればいい？どうすればいい？
What should I do? What should I do?

2738
01:56:00,184 --> 01:56:04,224
Don't worry, don't worry! Just a bit more, just a bit more, she'll...

2739
01:56:04,224 --> 01:56:05,224
オッケー！
Okay!

2740
01:56:05,224 --> 01:56:07,024
There you go, there you go!

2741
01:56:07,024 --> 01:56:10,184
イエーイ！ありがとう！
Yay! Thank you!

2742
01:56:10,184 --> 01:56:12,944
Welcome back! やったー！
Welcome back! Yay!

2743
01:56:12,944 --> 01:56:14,064
ありがとう！すみません！
Thank you! I'm sorry!

2744
01:56:14,224 --> 01:56:15,544
No problem!

2745
01:56:15,544 --> 01:56:17,064
Here's your item.

2746
01:56:17,064 --> 01:56:17,984
はい！
Yes!

2747
01:56:18,424 --> 01:56:20,704
Yeah, Mela, it's your backpack here.

2748
01:56:20,704 --> 01:56:22,544
あ、サンキューサンキュー！ソーリーソーリー！
Ah, thank you, thank you! Sorry, sorry!

2749
01:56:22,584 --> 01:56:25,424
I don't think I can carry this anymore...

2750
01:56:25,424 --> 01:56:27,424
I'll carry the chain launcher though.

2751
01:56:30,584 --> 01:56:31,704
I got this.

2752
01:56:31,704 --> 01:56:32,664
オッケー！
Okay!

2753
01:56:32,664 --> 01:56:36,184
We need to wait a bit for the poison...

2754
01:56:39,304 --> 01:56:40,264
行けるか？
Can we go?

2755
01:56:40,304 --> 01:56:42,704
Biboo-senpai, are you hungry?

2756
01:56:43,184 --> 01:56:47,344
えっと、I am... legs broken! 痛い痛い！
Umm, I am... legs broken! Ouch, ouch!

2757
01:56:47,384 --> 01:56:48,744
じゃあ、無理か。
Then I guess it's impossible.

2758
01:56:48,784 --> 01:56:51,424
I can't do anything for you.

2759
01:56:51,464 --> 01:56:53,224
大丈夫。
It's fine.

2760
01:56:53,264 --> 01:56:54,864
どうやって行った？そこ。
How did you go there?

2761
01:56:56,424 --> 01:56:57,344
これか？
This one?

2762
01:56:56,704 --> 01:56:59,224
ここね、これ。
Here, this one.

2763
01:56:59,264 --> 01:57:00,264
このツル。
This vine.

2764
01:57:00,264 --> 01:57:01,504
あー、オッケーわかった。
Ah, okay, got it.

2765
01:57:02,224 --> 01:57:04,784
How... how... here?

2766
01:57:05,104 --> 01:57:06,864
でもこっち正しいかわかんないから。
But I don't know if this is the right way.

2767
01:57:06,864 --> 01:57:07,624
オッケー。
Okay.

2768
01:57:09,864 --> 01:57:12,064
今、物資がないか見てる感じ。
Right now, I'm checking if there are any supplies.

2769
01:57:12,184 --> 01:57:12,904
Thank you!

2770
01:57:12,944 --> 01:57:14,864
今探してるらしい。
Looks like she's searching right now.

2771
01:57:15,184 --> 01:57:16,304
Watching for some...

2772
01:57:16,304 --> 01:57:17,504
回復したいね、できれば。
I'd like to heal if possible.

2773
01:57:17,504 --> 01:57:18,704
回復したいね！
We want to heal, right!

2774
01:57:20,304 --> 01:57:22,024
スーツケースとか欲しいけどにゃ。
I'd like a suitcase or something, though.

2775
01:57:22,024 --> 01:57:25,984
あ、毒とか危ない！It's explosion and poison...
Ah, poison and stuff are dangerous! It's explosion and poison...

2776
01:57:26,744 --> 01:57:29,984
色々あって危ない、この場所。このマップ。
There are many dangerous things here, this place. This map.

2777
01:57:31,104 --> 01:57:32,664
Where can we...

2778
01:57:33,464 --> 01:57:36,664
Where can we go? どこにあるかな？
Where can we go? Where could it be?

2779
01:57:36,984 --> 01:57:38,904
あれはっち... あれは開けたやつか？
That over there... Is that the opened one?

2780
01:57:39,184 --> 01:57:40,184
多分ね。
Probably.

2781
01:57:41,424 --> 01:57:43,264
ないの、なかなか。
There's really nothing around.

2782
01:57:43,304 --> 01:57:46,504
Okay, Kyoko, it's time to be cool!

2783
01:57:46,504 --> 01:57:47,544
助けたい！
I want to help!

2784
01:57:47,544 --> 01:57:51,224
Okay, I'm gonna be the cool and grab them up!
Okay, I'm gonna be cool and grab them up!

2785
01:57:52,464 --> 01:57:54,864
That sounds good. Okay, I gotta keep going then.

2786
01:57:54,984 --> 01:57:57,064
Keep going? 雨！
Keep going? Rain!

2787
01:57:57,784 --> 01:57:59,264
危ない！
Dangerous!

2788
01:57:59,264 --> 01:58:00,264
Rain.

2789
01:58:00,904 --> 01:58:02,344
ウェイト。
Wait.

2790
01:58:02,664 --> 01:58:04,104
待つ。
Wait.

2791
01:58:05,344 --> 01:58:07,344
Ah, the poison plant...

2792
01:58:07,624 --> 01:58:11,544
そこってどうやって行くんじゃっけ？ How can I go there, right there?
How do we go there again? How can I go there, right there?

2793
01:58:11,944 --> 01:58:14,904
Uh, that tree.

2794
01:58:14,984 --> 01:58:16,984
そこ苦手なんだよな、わし、この...
I'm bad at that, this...

2795
01:58:18,024 --> 01:58:22,264
木の上に登るのがね、苦手なんだよな。
Climbing on top of trees is something I'm bad at.

2796
01:58:25,224 --> 01:58:26,744
プロリンジャンプ...
Pro jump...

2797
01:58:26,864 --> 01:58:29,984
でもちょっと落ちたらダメージ行っちゃって怖いから...
But if I fall a bit, taking damage is scary, so...

2798
01:58:30,464 --> 01:58:31,944
つた... か？
A vine... maybe?

2799
01:58:32,024 --> 01:58:34,384
それか最終的にあそこに行ければいいなら、壁...
Or if we just need to end up over there in the end, the wall...

2800
01:58:35,584 --> 01:58:37,944
最終的にそこに行ければいいなら...
If we just need to get over there eventually...

2801
01:58:38,464 --> 01:58:39,624
Be careful! Be careful!

2802
01:58:39,624 --> 01:58:40,584
あ、行けた！
Ah, made it!

2803
01:58:40,584 --> 01:58:41,424
Yeah yeah yeah, got it, got it.

2804
01:58:41,424 --> 01:58:43,024
行けた、行けた！上手！
Made it, made it! Nice job!

2805
01:58:43,064 --> 01:58:43,864
おいしょ。
Up we go.

2806
01:58:44,384 --> 01:58:47,064
あん？はー！キョーコどうやってそこ行った？
Huh? Wow! Kyoko, how did you get there?

2807
01:58:48,544 --> 01:58:50,264
えっとね、ここ。
Let's see, right here.

2808
01:58:51,224 --> 01:58:52,184
ここ。
Here.

2809
01:58:53,824 --> 01:58:54,864
こっから掴める？
Can you grab from here?

2810
01:58:54,864 --> 01:58:59,864
あ、ちょっとでも、ちょっとでも緑のところは休めるから。
Ah, even if it's just a tiny green spot, you can rest there.

2811
01:58:59,864 --> 01:59:03,384
そう言うとこうまく利用していくと上がりやすいよ。
If you make good use of spots like that, it's easier to climb up.

2812
01:59:03,424 --> 01:59:04,344
いった。
Got it.

2813
01:59:04,344 --> 01:59:06,304
こういうさ、チョッ... ちょっと緑あるじゃん。
Like these spots, see... there's a little green.

2814
01:59:06,304 --> 01:59:07,104
あー、オッケー！
Ah, okay!

2815
01:59:07,904 --> 01:59:08,984
どうしようかな？
What should I do?

2816
01:59:09,024 --> 01:59:11,104
1回壁伝いで行っていいの？
Is it okay to go along the wall first?

2817
01:59:11,944 --> 01:59:13,664
うん、壁伝いに行った、私。
Yeah, I went along the wall.

2818
01:59:13,704 --> 01:59:14,504
オッケー。
Okay.

2819
01:59:15,744 --> 01:59:17,664
Dangerous, dangerous...

2820
01:59:17,704 --> 01:59:18,584
Maybe here?

2821
01:59:18,584 --> 01:59:19,584
ここが...
This is...

2822
01:59:19,584 --> 01:59:21,264
Dangerous... 安全地帯？
Dangerous... safe zone?

2823
01:59:22,224 --> 01:59:23,184
あんんで...
And then...

2824
01:59:23,904 --> 01:59:24,944
こっちか？
Is it this way?

2825
01:59:25,744 --> 01:59:27,944
Kaela-senpai watching everybody.

2826
01:59:27,944 --> 01:59:29,984
こっちか？こっちか？こっち！
This way? This way? This way!

2827
01:59:29,984 --> 01:59:30,984
あ、そうそうそうそう。
Ah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

2828
01:59:30,984 --> 01:59:32,664
オッケー、グレート！グレート！
Okay, great! Great!

2829
01:59:32,704 --> 01:59:35,144
I think you can just go behind Hugh, right? Yeah, later.

2830
01:59:36,184 --> 01:59:37,584
オッケー。Wait a minute.
Okay. Wait a minute.

2831
01:59:37,584 --> 01:59:39,104
これでここに行く...
With this, going here...

2832
01:59:39,104 --> 01:59:40,984
Watch out! There's... 危ない！
Watch out! There's... Watch out!

2833
01:59:40,984 --> 01:59:42,744
Poison fungus! Explosive fungus! Explosionある！
Poison fungus! Explosive fungus! There's an explosion!

2834
01:59:42,744 --> 01:59:44,984
Yeah, be careful, be careful! Be careful!

2835
01:59:44,984 --> 01:59:46,064
Be careful!

2836
01:59:46,224 --> 01:59:46,984
あぶにゃい。
Dangerous.

2837
01:59:46,984 --> 01:59:52,744
It's raining hot weather... it's raining rain, right? Her stamina is not that much, yeah.

2838
01:59:53,224 --> 01:59:54,864
Yeah, take your time.

2839
01:59:55,504 --> 01:59:57,024
ちょっとあぶにゃい。
A little dangerous.

2840
01:59:57,064 --> 01:59:57,904
食べたい。
I want to eat.

2841
01:59:57,904 --> 01:59:59,504
Call me one Kaela, yes.

2842
01:59:59,624 --> 02:00:00,368
みょーちゃん。
Myo-chan.

2843
02:00:00,792 --> 02:00:02,392
あ、食べてもいいの？
Oh, can I eat this?

2844
02:00:03,592 --> 02:00:05,592
ソーセージあるし
Because we have sausages...

2845
02:00:05,992 --> 02:00:07,692
Oh, you got it!

2846
02:00:07,192 --> 02:00:08,992
ポテトもあるよ
We also have potatoes.

2847
02:00:08,592 --> 02:00:10,192
Watch out, watch out!

2848
02:00:10,392 --> 02:00:11,992
のじゃ！
Noja!

2849
02:00:11,892 --> 02:00:12,892
え？
Huh?

2850
02:00:12,592 --> 02:00:13,992
And now what? Now what?

2851
02:00:13,992 --> 02:00:16,992
No, you can go... Yeah, you can go in...

2852
02:00:17,092 --> 02:00:18,392
どこかいにゃ？
Where to go?

2853
02:00:18,792 --> 02:00:20,692
Wait, maybe I can...

2854
02:00:20,692 --> 02:00:23,192
You can go that way, yeah, yeah, that way. Just go that way.

2855
02:00:23,192 --> 02:00:25,692
I still have a chain launcher if you need it.

2856
02:00:24,692 --> 02:00:28,192
You can stand on the thingy... Yes, yes, yes, you can stand...

2857
02:00:28,192 --> 02:00:29,192
Okay!

2858
02:00:28,792 --> 02:00:30,992
And then? And then? And then?

2859
02:00:30,992 --> 02:00:32,592
ここに...
Over here...

2860
02:00:32,392 --> 02:00:35,192
And then you can actually go up. Go up, go up! Go up, I say!

2861
02:00:34,392 --> 02:00:36,192
登る？登る...
Climb up? Climb up...

2862
02:00:35,992 --> 02:00:38,192
No, no, no, not that way. You're...

2863
02:00:38,192 --> 02:00:40,192
Yeah, back, back...

2864
02:00:39,992 --> 02:00:41,692
Can I take this vine?

2865
02:00:41,692 --> 02:00:43,192
Yes, yes, yes!

2866
02:00:43,192 --> 02:00:45,192
あ、そこか！
Ah, over there?

2867
02:00:44,392 --> 02:00:45,992
That works, too. Yeah.

2868
02:00:45,592 --> 02:00:46,592
Okay.

2869
02:00:46,592 --> 02:00:49,192
Be careful, be careful! Yes, yeah, okay.

2870
02:00:49,592 --> 02:00:52,692
よいしょ！よいしょ！
Yoisho! Yoisho!

2871
02:00:52,792 --> 02:00:54,192
よいしょ！
Yoisho!

2872
02:00:54,992 --> 02:00:57,192
Why is it so unstable?

2873
02:00:56,992 --> 02:00:58,692
Okay, okay, okay, got it.

2874
02:00:58,492 --> 02:00:59,192
Okay.

2875
02:00:58,992 --> 02:01:00,792
Got it, got it, got it!

2876
02:01:00,592 --> 02:01:02,192
キョーコ、どこ行った？
Kyoko, where did you go?

2877
02:01:02,192 --> 02:01:03,692
ちょっと上。
A bit higher up.

2878
02:01:03,692 --> 02:01:05,692
木の上にいるよ、今。
I'm on top of the tree right now.

2879
02:01:04,392 --> 02:01:05,192
ちょっと？
A bit?

2880
02:01:05,992 --> 02:01:06,992
どこ行った？
Where did you go?

2881
02:01:07,692 --> 02:01:08,892
真上！
Directly above!

2882
02:01:08,692 --> 02:01:10,192
あ、でも探さなくて大丈夫、大丈夫。
Ah, but you don't need to look for me, it's okay, it's okay.

2883
02:01:10,192 --> 02:01:11,792
オーケー！
Okay!

2884
02:01:11,392 --> 02:01:12,792
後ろだよ。
Behind you.

2885
02:01:12,792 --> 02:01:15,192
うわ、危ない！滑落する！
Woah, dangerous! I'm falling!

2886
02:01:14,392 --> 02:01:16,192
I don't think you can...

2887
02:01:15,592 --> 02:01:16,792
危ない、危ない。
Dangerous, dangerous.

2888
02:01:16,792 --> 02:01:17,992
怖い...
Scary...

2889
02:01:17,792 --> 02:01:19,592
ここ結構いいのじゃ。
Here is pretty good, noja.

2890
02:01:18,992 --> 02:01:21,192
You can walk, it's fine.

2891
02:01:20,792 --> 02:01:23,192
ほら、あそこにさ、今、真上？
Look, over there, right above us?

2892
02:01:22,592 --> 02:01:23,792
うん、うん、真上。
Yeah, yeah, right above.

2893
02:01:23,192 --> 02:01:25,692
青いの、青い光あるでしょ？
The blue thing, there's a blue light, right?

2894
02:01:25,492 --> 02:01:27,692
今ちょっと見えないけど、あるのじゃの？
I can't see it right now, but it's there, noja?

2895
02:01:27,592 --> 02:01:29,192
真上にあるのね。
It's right above us, right.

2896
02:01:28,992 --> 02:01:32,592
あれが前回うちらが行ったところで、結構頂上近かったから...
That's where we went last time, and it was pretty close to the summit...

2897
02:01:31,892 --> 02:01:32,692
はい！
Yes!

2898
02:01:32,592 --> 02:01:34,692
割といい感じ今。
We're doing pretty good right now.

2899
02:01:33,592 --> 02:01:34,892
オーケー！
Okay!

2900
02:01:35,592 --> 02:01:37,592
あ、でもちょっと美ぶ先輩が...
Ah, but Biboo-senpai is...

2901
02:01:38,392 --> 02:01:39,392
オーケー！
Okay!

2902
02:01:39,392 --> 02:01:41,392
Wait for Biboo-senpai.

2903
02:01:40,592 --> 02:01:41,992
下に居るな。
She's below us.

2904
02:01:42,392 --> 02:01:43,792
安全に待つ？
Should we wait safely?

2905
02:01:44,992 --> 02:01:46,192
大丈夫かな？
Is she okay?

2906
02:01:46,592 --> 02:01:48,992
「アワワワ」って聞こえる。
I can hear "awawawa".

2907
02:01:48,692 --> 02:01:50,192
オーケー、オーケー！
Okay, okay!

2908
02:01:50,192 --> 02:01:51,192
オーケー！
Okay!

2909
02:01:51,192 --> 02:01:52,692
I see.

2910
02:01:51,992 --> 02:01:54,192
姿が見えなくて怖いノー。
Not being able to see her is terrifying.

2911
02:01:53,792 --> 02:01:56,692
わしもね、ちょっと見えなくて不安なのじゃ。
I'm also a bit anxious because I can't see, noja.

2912
02:01:56,992 --> 02:01:58,692
視界が悪いとね...
When visibility is bad...

2913
02:01:58,592 --> 02:02:00,792
あ、本当だ！青い光見ゆる！
Ah, it's true! I see the blue light!

2914
02:02:00,392 --> 02:02:03,192
I can see blue light!

2915
02:02:03,192 --> 02:02:05,192
Blue light thingy.

2916
02:02:04,992 --> 02:02:08,992
Kyoko, I think Bijou needs a little bit of help there.

2917
02:02:08,792 --> 02:02:10,692
Yeah, I can come help.

2918
02:02:11,192 --> 02:02:13,392
Yeah, her energy is too low.

2919
02:02:12,892 --> 02:02:13,992
オーケー！
Okay!

2920
02:02:13,992 --> 02:02:15,692
You need to grab her.

2921
02:02:15,092 --> 02:02:16,992
じゃあ見てる！
Then I'll watch!

2922
02:02:16,792 --> 02:02:18,692
I'm watching that.

2923
02:02:19,592 --> 02:02:23,192
素人が下手に応急救助しようとすると死んじゃうから...
If an amateur tries to do emergency rescue poorly, people die, so...

2924
02:02:23,192 --> 02:02:26,692
わしは静観しますのじゃ。
I shall stand by and observe, noja.

2925
02:02:26,192 --> 02:02:27,592
勇気ある...
You are brave...

2926
02:02:27,692 --> 02:02:30,992
