03:01:00,288 --> 03:01:02,788
でも登る！ 登ってみる！
But I'll climb! I'll try climbing!

4152
03:01:02,788 --> 03:01:05,088
登ってみるのじゃ！
I'm going to try climbing!

4153
03:01:05,788 --> 03:01:07,788
あれご飯？ ご飯じゃない、あれキノコ。
Is that food? Not food, that's mushrooms.

4154
03:01:07,788 --> 03:01:10,788
向こうなんだよな、多分。
It's over there, probably.

4155
03:01:10,788 --> 03:01:12,788
反響すごくない？
The echo is crazy, isn't it?

4156
03:01:12,788 --> 03:01:16,288
ちょ、雨が止んだらここから登ってみようかな？
Wait, when the rain stops, maybe I'll try climbing up from here.

4157
03:01:16,288 --> 03:01:23,288
When rain stopped, I'll go... going up!
When the rain stops, I'll... go up!

4158
03:01:23,788 --> 03:01:26,788
ね... 結構落ちちゃったな...
Man... I fell down pretty far...

4159
03:01:26,788 --> 03:01:31,288
やっぱどこに登るかをちゃんと見てから登んなきゃダメっぽいな。
Looks like I really need to check where to climb before I start climbing.

4160
03:01:31,288 --> 03:01:33,088
あ、これ無理か...
Ah, is this impossible...

4161
03:01:33,288 --> 03:01:34,788
行けるか？
Can I make it?

4162
03:01:34,788 --> 03:01:36,788
あー、足りねえな。
Ah, not enough stamina.

4163
03:01:36,788 --> 03:01:39,288
あー、足りない... 足りなさそう。
Ah, not enough... doesn't look like enough.

4164
03:01:39,788 --> 03:01:42,788
OK. こっちがダメなら、じゃあそっち行って...
OK. If this way doesn't work, then I'll go over there...

4165
03:01:43,788 --> 03:01:45,788
こっち行って... Right here?
Go this way... Right here?

4166
03:01:46,288 --> 03:01:49,288
このまま行こうか... が現実的か？
Is going straight like this... the most realistic option?

4167
03:01:49,788 --> 03:01:51,488
おりて...
Go down and...

4168
03:01:54,288 --> 03:01:57,288
Okay, so you guys...

4169
03:01:54,788 --> 03:01:58,288
ご飯とかあったらいいんだけど... ご飯とか...
I wish there were food or something... food...

4170
03:02:00,288 --> 03:02:03,288
水色のバナナまずそうだな... ちょっと良くないな。
Light blue bananas look unappetizing... Not great.

4171
03:02:04,288 --> 03:02:06,288
結構下かも... 結構下だな。
Might be pretty far down... Yeah, pretty far down.

4172
03:02:12,088 --> 03:02:17,088
なんかアイテムもないか探してみる。 I'm looking for some items.
I'll check if there are any items. I'm looking for some items.

4173
03:02:18,788 --> 03:02:21,288
あ！ スーツケースある！
Ah! There's a suitcase!

4174
03:02:22,288 --> 03:02:24,288
いいのがありますように！
Hope there's something good inside!

4175
03:02:24,788 --> 03:02:26,788
ロープキャノンだって！
It's a Rope Cannon!

4176
03:02:26,788 --> 03:02:29,788
What is that? What is that?

4177
03:02:30,788 --> 03:02:34,788
How... How I... How can I use it?
How... How can I use it?

4178
03:02:35,288 --> 03:02:38,288
How can I do... なんかめっちゃ強そう！
How can I do... It looks super strong!

4179
03:02:38,288 --> 03:02:39,788
いいんじゃない？
Isn't this great?

4180
03:02:41,088 --> 03:02:44,488
I think I can't use it, but...

4181
03:02:44,488 --> 03:02:46,288
Noja, Noja, Noja!

4182
03:02:45,288 --> 03:02:46,788
のじゃ！
Noja!

4183
03:02:46,788 --> 03:02:47,788
Here, I can see you.

4184
03:02:47,288 --> 03:02:48,788
あー！ Here!
Ah! Here!

4185
03:02:49,288 --> 03:02:53,288
I have ロープキャノン to スカウトキャノンある！
I have a Rope Cannon and a Scout Cannon!

4186
03:02:53,288 --> 03:02:56,288
How... How I can...
How... How can I...

4187
03:02:57,288 --> 03:02:59,288
Wait wait wait wait wait...

4188
03:03:00,288 --> 03:03:03,088
どうやったらいかな？ ロープキャノン...
How should I use this? Rope Cannon...

4189
03:03:05,788 --> 03:03:07,788
Wait, wait a minute.

4190
03:03:07,288 --> 03:03:08,788
OK, I'm waiting!

4191
03:03:12,288 --> 03:03:14,088
大砲の中に座って？
Sit inside the cannon?

4192
03:03:14,288 --> 03:03:17,288
え、じゃあ大砲で行ってもいいんじゃない？
Eh, then shouldn't it be fine to go using the cannon?

4193
03:03:20,288 --> 03:03:23,288
カエラ先輩助けに来てくれたー！
Kaela-senpai came to save me!

4194
03:03:25,788 --> 03:03:29,288
Then I wait. 待つのじゃ。
Then I wait. I'll wait.

4195
03:03:30,288 --> 03:03:32,288
使ったことはない...
I've never used it...

4196
03:03:32,288 --> 03:03:35,288
使ったことないアイテムを急に使うのは危ないのじゃ。
It's dangerous to suddenly use an item I've never used before.

4197
03:03:35,288 --> 03:03:37,288
先輩が助けて... あ、飛距離あんまないんだ。
Senpai will save... Ah, it doesn't have much range.

4198
03:03:37,288 --> 03:03:39,288
Okay, okay, Noja...

4199
03:03:39,288 --> 03:03:40,288
Yes!

4200
03:03:40,288 --> 03:03:42,288
Move forward a little bit. Move front...

4201
03:03:42,788 --> 03:03:46,788
...a little bit. No, no, that's backward.

4202
03:03:46,788 --> 03:03:47,788
OK!

4203
03:03:47,788 --> 03:03:52,788
Okay okay, go front, go front a little bit little bit little bit, a little bit more. Okay okay okay okay.

4204
03:03:52,788 --> 03:03:54,088
OK!

4205
03:03:54,088 --> 03:03:55,488
のじゃー！
Noja~!

4206
03:03:56,788 --> 03:03:58,788
Thank you!

4207
03:04:00,288 --> 03:04:03,288
カエラ先輩, I can... I'm... Do you want this?
Kaela-senpai, I can... I'm... Do you want this?

4208
03:04:03,288 --> 03:04:05,288
Okay, Rope Cannon?

4209
03:04:03,788 --> 03:04:06,288
I can't use it!

4210
03:04:06,288 --> 03:04:08,288
We can...

4211
03:04:06,788 --> 03:04:08,788
I'm not good at using this.

4212
03:04:10,788 --> 03:04:12,788
...Rope Cannon, wait.

4213
03:04:12,788 --> 03:04:14,288
And I have this too!

4214
03:04:14,288 --> 03:04:16,288
カエラ先輩, I have Scout Cannon too!
Kaela-senpai, I have Scout Cannon too!

4215
03:04:15,788 --> 03:04:19,788
What... what... Woah!

4216
03:04:19,788 --> 03:04:22,788
How can... I don't know how to use that too!
How can... I don't know how to use that either!

4217
03:04:21,288 --> 03:04:22,788
I don't know how to use that too.
I don't know how to use that either.

4218
03:04:22,788 --> 03:04:24,288
Oh okay okay. Then now...

4219
03:04:25,288 --> 03:04:27,288
What is Scout Cannon?

4220
03:04:26,788 --> 03:04:29,788
What is Scout Cannon... なんかウイーって...
What is Scout Cannon... It goes whoosh or something...

4221
03:04:32,288 --> 03:04:33,288
にょ？ あ！
Nyo? Ah!

4222
03:04:33,288 --> 03:04:38,788
Can I eat... carrot? Can I eat carrot?
Can I eat... carrot? Can I eat a carrot?

4223
03:04:38,288 --> 03:04:39,288
Carrot?

4224
03:04:39,288 --> 03:04:41,288
Can I eat this?

4225
03:04:40,788 --> 03:04:42,788
Oh, this one?

4226
03:04:41,788 --> 03:04:42,788
Yes!

4227
03:04:43,288 --> 03:04:44,488
You hurt?

4228
03:04:44,288 --> 03:04:46,288
Yes, I'm hurt! Thank you!

4229
03:04:45,288 --> 03:04:48,288
Okay okay okay okay.

4230
03:04:47,288 --> 03:04:48,788
Thank you!

4231
03:04:48,788 --> 03:04:52,788
And then... Okay.

4232
03:04:53,288 --> 03:04:56,788
Now we can go... What is that?

4233
03:05:02,696 --> 03:05:04,496
これ先輩にあげよう
I'll give this to Senpai.

4234
03:05:05,796 --> 03:05:07,396
先輩にあげよう
I'll give this to Senpai.

4235
03:05:08,296 --> 03:05:09,096
Okay.

4236
03:05:09,896 --> 03:05:11,396
Uh, go this way.

4237
03:05:11,396 --> 03:05:12,996
Go this way?

4238
03:05:13,096 --> 03:05:14,596
雨降ってきた
It started raining.

4239
03:05:15,796 --> 03:05:16,996
And...

4240
03:05:17,096 --> 03:05:17,896
Okay.

4241
03:05:17,996 --> 03:05:19,396
Energy okay?

4242
03:05:19,396 --> 03:05:20,396
Energy?

4243
03:05:20,396 --> 03:05:21,296
What?

4244
03:05:21,296 --> 03:05:23,496
Your energy is good? No?

4245
03:05:23,596 --> 03:05:25,796
Um, only half.

4246
03:05:26,096 --> 03:05:27,696
Okay, half.

4247
03:05:30,096 --> 03:05:31,796
Actually, less than half.

4248
03:05:32,796 --> 03:05:34,296
Less than half. Okay.

4249
03:05:40,096 --> 03:05:41,796
I don't know, where should I...

4250
03:05:44,096 --> 03:05:46,196
カエラ先輩優しいのじゃ
Kaela-senpai is so nice.

4251
03:05:47,596 --> 03:05:48,796
チェーン
Chain.

4252
03:05:50,796 --> 03:05:52,296
行くのじゃ
Let me go!

4253
03:05:52,296 --> 03:05:57,796
のじゃ、のじゃ、のじゃ...
Noja, noja, noja...

4254
03:05:57,996 --> 03:05:58,996
よいしょ
Heave-ho!

4255
03:05:59,096 --> 03:05:59,996
やべっ
Oh shoot!

4256
03:06:00,096 --> 03:06:01,196
Oops!

4257
03:06:01,696 --> 03:06:04,196
にょ... にょ...
Nyo... nyo...

4258
03:06:04,296 --> 03:06:05,596
Okay, okay, 大丈夫？
Okay, okay, are you alright?

4259
03:06:05,596 --> 03:06:07,696
大丈夫！ It's okay!
I'm okay! It's okay!

4260
03:06:07,696 --> 03:06:08,796
Okay, okay, okay.

4261
03:06:08,896 --> 03:06:11,196
Can... Can you jump up?

4262
03:06:11,196 --> 03:06:12,996
Here. Yes?

4263
03:06:13,096 --> 03:06:14,096
Oops!

4264
03:06:14,996 --> 03:06:17,096
My stamina...

4265
03:06:18,096 --> 03:06:19,096
いけるか
Can I make it?

4266
03:06:19,096 --> 03:06:20,096
よいしょ
Heave-ho!

4267
03:06:20,396 --> 03:06:22,696
なんかすごい叫び声聞こえるけど大丈夫か？
I hear someone screaming, is everyone okay?

4268
03:06:23,996 --> 03:06:25,496
回復待って...
Waiting for stamina to recover...

4269
03:06:25,496 --> 03:06:26,996
なんか叫んでるな
Someone's screaming.

4270
03:06:26,996 --> 03:06:28,796
よいしょ、いけるか？
Heave-ho, can I make it?

4271
03:06:28,796 --> 03:06:32,196
よいしょ、よいしょ、よいしょ...
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho...

4272
03:06:32,196 --> 03:06:33,496
よいしょ、いけるか？ ほっ
Heave-ho, can I make it? Hop!

4273
03:06:33,496 --> 03:06:34,596
いけたか
Did I make it?

4274
03:06:34,596 --> 03:06:35,296
Okay.

4275
03:06:35,296 --> 03:06:37,596
And カエラ先輩がそこに居るのね。 Okay.
And Kaela-senpai is over there. Okay.

4276
03:06:37,596 --> 03:06:38,496
I'm okay!

4277
03:06:38,496 --> 03:06:41,096
I'm up here! I'm up here!

4278
03:06:41,096 --> 03:06:41,996
Okay!

4279
03:06:41,996 --> 03:06:43,996
いけるか... いけるか...
Can I make it... can I make it...

4280
03:06:43,996 --> 03:06:44,996
にょじゃ
Nyoja!

4281
03:06:44,996 --> 03:06:45,996
Okay, okay!

4282
03:06:45,996 --> 03:06:47,096
Oops, にょ！
Oops, nyo!

4283
03:06:48,096 --> 03:06:49,096
Oops!

4284
03:06:49,096 --> 03:06:51,396
I have no stamina.

4285
03:06:51,396 --> 03:06:52,696
いけるかな
Can I make it?

4286
03:06:53,096 --> 03:06:54,496
After...

4287
03:06:54,496 --> 03:06:55,996
雨待つか
Should I wait for the rain?

4288
03:06:55,996 --> 03:06:57,396
雨を待って
Wait for the rain.

4289
03:06:57,396 --> 03:06:58,996
Rain, rain, rain, rain...

4290
03:06:58,996 --> 03:07:01,296
You can grab into the leaves of the tree.

4291
03:07:01,296 --> 03:07:02,396
Okay!

4292
03:07:05,996 --> 03:07:08,196
確かに、大砲落としていいな
True, dropping the cannon would be good.

4293
03:07:08,196 --> 03:07:09,396
えーっと
Let's see...

4294
03:07:09,896 --> 03:07:13,496
This is not the useful rope, guys. This is the rope going up.

4295
03:07:13,496 --> 03:07:14,596
よいしょ
Heave-ho!

4296
03:07:15,396 --> 03:07:17,096
Okay, I'm going.

4297
03:07:17,096 --> 03:07:19,696
よいしょ、よいしょ...
Heave-ho, heave-ho...

4298
03:07:19,696 --> 03:07:22,296
届くかな... 届かない
Can I reach it? ... I can't reach.

4299
03:07:22,296 --> 03:07:25,796
届かないな...
I can't reach...

4300
03:07:26,996 --> 03:07:27,996
行くか
Shall I go?

4301
03:07:27,996 --> 03:07:33,196
よいしょ、よいしょ、よいしょ...
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho...

4302
03:07:33,196 --> 03:07:34,296
掴めるかな
Can I grab on?

4303
03:07:34,296 --> 03:07:35,996
Not enough? Not enough...

4304
03:07:36,796 --> 03:07:38,496
Oops, のじゃ！
Oops, noja!

4305
03:07:40,296 --> 03:07:44,496
My stamina is not enough.

4306
03:07:44,496 --> 03:07:46,596
Okay, okay...

4307
03:07:49,096 --> 03:07:51,796
全回復してもムズいか？
Is it hard even with full stamina?

4308
03:07:52,996 --> 03:07:54,396
ちょっと足りない
A bit not enough.

4309
03:07:54,396 --> 03:07:56,796
Go stand this way.

4310
03:07:58,196 --> 03:08:00,396
なんかすごい上の方で叫び声聞こえる
I hear someone screaming way up above.

4311
03:08:00,396 --> 03:08:02,096
Oh, there is actually a way...

4312
03:08:02,096 --> 03:08:03,496
食べ物があるね
There's food.

4313
03:08:05,896 --> 03:08:07,696
Yes, another...

4314
03:08:08,796 --> 03:08:11,496
別の道を探したいのじゃが
I want to look for another way, but...

4315
03:08:11,496 --> 03:08:13,496
ここ落ちたら危ないかな
If I fall from here, will it be dangerous?

4316
03:08:15,296 --> 03:08:18,296
割とこの場所が積みではあって
This spot is pretty much a dead end...

4317
03:08:18,296 --> 03:08:20,896
ここもエクスプロージョンあるからな
There's an explosion here too.

4318
03:08:21,996 --> 03:08:23,796
Are you stuck until rope down, team?

4319
03:08:23,796 --> 03:08:26,796
あ、エクスプロージョンがあるからちょっとあんま行きたくないんだよな
Ah, there's an explosion, so I don't really wanna go there.

4320
03:08:27,196 --> 03:08:28,696
やべ、雨降ってきた
Oh shoot, it started raining.

4321
03:08:29,196 --> 03:08:32,196
Okay, Mela, Mela, Mela, come here, come here!

4322
03:08:32,196 --> 03:08:33,296
Okay!

4323
03:08:33,296 --> 03:08:35,596
Wait a minute, I don't have...

4324
03:08:35,596 --> 03:08:36,496
Stamina.

4325
03:08:36,496 --> 03:08:37,296
Okay, okay.

4326
03:08:37,296 --> 03:08:41,496
So I'm waiting for stop... stop raining.

4327
03:08:44,296 --> 03:08:45,896
食べ物あればいいんだけどな
I wish I had some food.

4328
03:08:46,896 --> 03:08:50,296
Yeah, food... I don't have food too.

4329
03:08:50,796 --> 03:08:53,596
よし、行きますのじゃ！ のじゃ！
Alright, here I go! Noja!

4330
03:08:53,596 --> 03:08:55,996
Come here! Come here!

4331
03:08:56,796 --> 03:08:57,896
Wait.

4332
03:08:57,896 --> 03:08:59,296
One more.

4333
03:08:59,296 --> 03:09:00,296
えーっと
Let's see...

4334
03:09:00,296 --> 03:09:02,796
よいしょ！ のじゃ！ のじゃ！ Thank you!
Heave-ho! Noja! Noja! Thank you!

4335
03:09:02,796 --> 03:09:04,296
Okay, okay.

4336
03:09:04,296 --> 03:09:06,296
And then we just...

4337
03:09:07,796 --> 03:09:11,796
Wait, yeah, can we like go higher...

4338
03:09:11,796 --> 03:09:13,296
Hm-hm-hm!

4339
03:09:13,296 --> 03:09:14,596
...here?

4340
03:09:15,296 --> 03:09:17,096
Yeah, very nice.

4341
03:09:18,096 --> 03:09:21,296
ちょっと、ちょっと、のじゃ！ のじゃ！
Wait, wait, noja! Noja!

4342
03:09:21,296 --> 03:09:23,296
のじゃ！ わ、セーフ！
Noja! Wow, safe!

4343
03:09:25,296 --> 03:09:26,796
カエラ先輩どこ行った？
Where did Kaela-senpai go?

4344
03:09:26,796 --> 03:09:27,996
あ、居た
Ah, there she is.

4345
03:09:27,996 --> 03:09:28,896
ちょっと...
Hold on...

4346
03:09:31,296 --> 03:09:34,496
これ放っておいたら落ちちゃうのか？ ちょっと危ないの
If I leave this, will I fall? That's a bit dangerous.

4347
03:09:34,496 --> 03:09:36,796
うん、うん、うん
Mm, mm, mm.

4348
03:09:37,296 --> 03:09:38,496
怖い
Scary!

4349
03:09:38,496 --> 03:09:39,396
Okay.

4350
03:09:40,296 --> 03:09:43,896
よいしょ、よいしょ...
Heave-ho, heave-ho...

4351
03:09:44,496 --> 03:09:47,296
Then let's go this way.

4352
03:09:47,296 --> 03:09:48,596
Oops!

4353
03:09:48,596 --> 03:09:51,096
いけるか... いける。 Okay.
Can I make it... I can. Okay.

4354
03:09:51,096 --> 03:09:52,296
Thank you!

4355
03:09:52,296 --> 03:09:53,296
Okay.

4356
03:09:53,796 --> 03:09:54,896
いけた！
I made it!

4357
03:09:54,896 --> 03:09:58,296
Then be careful! Be careful!

4358
03:09:58,296 --> 03:09:59,496
Be careful!

4359
03:10:00,304 --> 03:10:01,704
ちょっと爆発が怖いな。
Explosions are a bit scary...

4360
03:10:01,704 --> 03:10:03,104
あっ！やばい、毒...
Oops! Oh no, poison...

4361
03:10:03,104 --> 03:10:04,404
大丈夫！大丈夫！
It's okay! It's okay!

4362
03:10:03,504 --> 03:10:05,704
やばい！毒やばい！
Oh no! Poison is bad!

4363
03:10:05,704 --> 03:10:07,104
行けるかな？
Can I make it?

4364
03:10:07,104 --> 03:10:10,804
Maybe not... Maybe not... Maybe not good.

4365
03:10:10,304 --> 03:10:12,304
やばい！毒で死ぬ！
Oh no! I'm gonna die from poison!

4366
03:10:11,604 --> 03:10:14,104
Wait wait wait, no no no no...

4367
03:10:14,104 --> 03:10:15,304
