But health isn't dropping! It isn't dropping so I can make it!

4592
03:19:46,297 --> 03:19:47,699
Maybe it's okay のじゃ？
Maybe it's okay?

4593
03:19:48,700 --> 03:19:49,501
It's okay.

4594
03:19:49,601 --> 03:19:51,603
大丈夫、大丈夫。
It's fine, it's fine.

4595
03:19:51,603 --> 03:19:52,837
It's okay, it's okay.

4596
03:19:52,937 --> 03:19:53,705
Okay.

4597
03:19:53,805 --> 03:19:54,973
All good!

4598
03:19:54,973 --> 03:19:55,840
Yes, good!

4599
03:19:55,940 --> 03:19:58,009
