03:19:58,109 --> 03:20:00,312
I can't catch fruit!

4601
03:20:00,640 --> 03:20:01,620
Food?

4602
03:20:01,620 --> 03:20:03,320
よいしょ！
Heave-ho!

4603
03:20:03,320 --> 03:20:05,820
