You good?

4609
03:20:16,820 --> 03:20:17,820
上手？
Are you good at it?

4610
03:20:17,820 --> 03:20:19,820
上手、Biboo-senpai!
So good, Biboo-senpai!

4611
03:20:19,820 --> 03:20:21,320
