4615
03:20:29,820 --> 03:20:31,820
あ、ててててて。
Ah, te-te-te-te-te.

4616
03:20:31,820 --> 03:20:32,820
てて。
Te-te.

4617
03:20:32,820 --> 03:20:35,820
Human really likes te-te, I know.

4618
03:20:35,820 --> 03:20:38,820
てて... てて, and human likes Biboo-senpai.
Te-te... Te-te, and human likes Biboo-senpai.

4619
03:20:38,820 --> 03:20:40,320
Oh!

4620
03:20:40,320 --> 03:20:44,320
