4621
03:20:44,320 --> 03:20:46,320
寒い！ It's cold! 寒い...
It's cold! It's cold! Cold...

4622
03:20:46,320 --> 03:20:48,320
寒い！ It's cold!
Cold! It's cold!

4623
03:20:48,320 --> 03:20:50,320
Cold...

4624
03:20:50,320 --> 03:20:53,320
Cold...のじゃ。
Cold...

4625
03:20:53,320 --> 03:20:57,320
寒い... 寒い... 寒い...
Cold... Cold... Cold...

4626
03:20:57,320 --> 03:21:00,320
温めるのじゃ...
Need to warm up...

4627
03:21:00,320 --> 03:21:01,320
のじゃ...
Yep...

4628
03:21:01,320 --> 03:21:02,820
Good!

4629
03:21:02,820 --> 03:21:05,320
Okay... Good...

4630
03:21:05,820 --> 03:21:07,820
行くのじゃ！
Let's go!

4631
