Okay... We keep going?

4634
03:21:15,820 --> 03:21:17,820
向こう？
Over there?

4635
03:21:17,820 --> 03:21:21,320
こっち行った方がいいのかのじゃ？
Should we go this way?

4636
03:21:22,320 --> 03:21:24,320
That way.

4637
