That way. Oh, hi!

4638
03:21:26,820 --> 03:21:27,820
Yeah, that way.

4639
03:21:27,820 --> 03:21:29,320
This way, this way!

4640
03:21:29,320 --> 03:21:31,320
Blizzard will come soon! Really? Why? Why?

4641
03:21:31,320 --> 03:21:33,320
Why? Yeah, I have...

4642
03:21:33,320 --> 03:21:34,820
I'm scared!

4643
03:21:34,820 --> 03:21:36,320
のじゃ...
Yep...

4644
03:21:36,320 --> 03:21:37,820
Oops!

4645
03:21:37,820 --> 03:21:40,820
Yeah, blizzard... blizzard!

4646
03:21:40,820 --> 03:21:44,820
寒い！寒い！寒い！
Cold! Cold! Cold!

4647
03:21:45,320 --> 03:21:46,820
