Scary, the blizzard...

4648
03:21:46,820 --> 03:21:49,320
Hold each other! Hold each other for 1 second!

4649
03:21:49,320 --> 03:21:51,820
We're going to warm up... 寒い！寒い！寒い！
We're going to warm up... Cold! Cold! Cold!

4650
03:21:52,320 --> 03:21:54,320
寒い...
Cold...

4651
03:21:54,320 --> 03:21:57,320
寒い！冷たい！冷たいのじゃ！
Cold! Freezing! Freezing cold!

4652
03:21:58,820 --> 03:22:01,820
It's okay, keep going, keep going now!

4653
