Beacon! いいの無いかな？ Oh, nice!
Beacon! Wonder if there's anything good? Oh, nice!

4656
03:22:10,320 --> 03:22:13,320
回復できないかな？ Yeah, beacon is very helpful.
Can we heal up? Yeah, beacon is very helpful.

4657
03:22:13,320 --> 03:22:15,320
Beacon!

4658
03:22:16,320 --> 03:22:18,320
みんなちょっと回復したい？
Does everyone want to heal a bit?

4659
03:22:18,320 --> 03:22:22,820
ちょっとだから、今はいいかも。
Since it's just a little bit, maybe we're good for now.

4660
03:22:22,820 --> 03:22:25,320
Yeah. Thank you.

4661
03:22:25,820 --> 03:22:28,320
Oh, lots of food!

4662
03:22:28,320 --> 03:22:30,820
Lots of food? Here? Great! That's good.

4663
03:22:31,820 --> 03:22:33,820
やったのじゃ！
Yay!

4664
03:22:34,320 --> 03:22:36,820
