It's true, there's food.

4665
03:22:37,320 --> 03:22:39,820
Nam nam nam nam... One more berry!

4666
03:22:40,320 --> 03:22:42,820
やった！ I'm going to go grab it.
Yay! I'm going to go grab it.

4667
03:22:42,820 --> 03:22:45,320
Thank you! 高いとこにある。
Thank you! It's up high.

4668
03:22:45,320 --> 03:22:47,820
Great, Kyoko! くれるの？
Great, Kyoko! Are you giving it to me?

4669
03:22:47,820 --> 03:22:49,320
食べたい？ うん。
Do you want to eat it? Yeah.

4670
03:22:49,320 --> 03:22:51,820
まだちょっとしか... あ、Thank you!
My health is only down a bit... Ah, thank you!

4671
