でもどちらにしろちょっとは減ってたから助かったのじゃ。 I'm full now.
Either way, I was down a bit so that helped. I'm full now.

4672
03:22:55,820 --> 03:22:58,320
よかった、よかった！ Thank you!
Great, great! Thank you!

4673
03:22:58,320 --> 03:23:00,820
I'm full nowのじゃ。
I'm full now.

4674
