Uh-huh! Everybody wants to be cool!

4696
03:24:07,820 --> 03:24:09,820
Cool!

4697
03:24:09,820 --> 03:24:12,320
Blizzard soon, blizzard soon!

4698
03:24:12,320 --> 03:24:14,820
How? How can we know that?

4699
03:24:15,820 --> 03:24:21,320
She can sense it. Yeah, she feels it in her bones. Uh-huh, that's so cool.

4700
03:24:21,320 --> 03:24:24,320
I can sense it, yes. 凄い！ That's a pro-peeker!
I can sense it, yes. Amazing! That's a pro-peeker!

4701
03:24:24,320 --> 03:24:27,820
わし分かんない。プロピーカは吹雪が来る時間が分かるらしい。
I don't get it. Apparently pro-peekers know when a blizzard is coming.

4702
03:24:27,820 --> 03:24:31,320
察せるらしい。「来るぜ」って。
They can sense it, like "It's coming."

4703
03:24:31,320 --> 03:24:33,820
吹雪が来るぜ...
A blizzard is coming...

4704
03:24:33,820 --> 03:24:36,320
Keep going, keep going! 猛者の香り...
Keep going, keep going! Aura of a veteran...

4705
03:24:36,320 --> 03:24:38,320
凄いのじゃ！
Amazing!

4706
03:24:38,320 --> 03:24:41,320
Ah, the blue thing is over there!

4707
03:24:41,320 --> 03:24:44,320
Over there? Blue thing?

4708
03:24:44,320 --> 03:24:47,320
I don't know if it's worth it, but yeah, blue thing is over there.

4709
03:24:47,320 --> 03:24:50,320
On the right? 右にある？
On the right? Is it on the right?

4710
03:24:50,320 --> 03:24:53,320
We don't have the healing effigy, right? We do!

4711
03:24:53,320 --> 03:24:55,820
Oh, you do? Okay, okay! Yes!

4712
03:24:56,820 --> 03:24:59,320
So yeah, it might be important.

4713
03:25:00,908 --> 03:25:02,128
Ah! Ah! Ah!

4714
03:25:01,928 --> 03:25:03,728
We hold each other. It's blizzard!
We hold each other. It's a blizzard!

4715
03:25:03,728 --> 03:25:06,328
あっためる！ We hold each other...
Warm each other up! We hold each other...

4716
03:25:06,328 --> 03:25:09,828
あっためる！ Warm each other... Warm each other... Yeah!
Warm each other up! Warm each other... Warm each other... Yeah!

4717
03:25:09,828 --> 03:25:14,928
あっためる！ Hold each other, のじゃ！
Warm each other up! Hold each other!

4718
03:25:14,928 --> 03:25:17,828
ててて... のじゃ！
Teetee...

4719
03:25:17,828 --> 03:25:20,328
It's teetee! Teetee, のじゃ！
It's teetee! Teetee!

4720
03:25:20,528 --> 03:25:22,328
Teetee! I know!

4721
03:25:22,828 --> 03:25:24,828
Human really likes teetee.
Humans really like teetee.

4722
03:25:25,028 --> 03:25:27,828
Teetee! Teetee! Teetee!

4723
