Thank you, のじゃ！ Oh wait, shouldn't we go closer to the center?
Thank you! Oh wait, shouldn't we go closer to the center?

4730
03:25:44,528 --> 03:25:47,828
よし... あれ？ How can I... Thank you!
Alright... Huh? How can I... Thank you!

4731
03:25:48,128 --> 03:25:52,828
登れた！ There's like... things to climb on this side.
I climbed up! There are like... things to climb on this side.

4732
03:25:52,828 --> 03:25:57,328
Oh yeah, let me see. If we go closer to the edge, then there won't be much...

4733
03:25:57,328 --> 03:26:00,328
...blizzard, like going around to the edge. よいしょ！
...blizzard, like going around to the edge. Heave-ho!

4734
03:26:00,328 --> 03:26:04,828
Oh, it goes center and go to the blue thingy, I guess.
Oh, it goes center and goes to the blue thingy, I guess.

4735
03:26:05,828 --> 03:26:09,328
よいしょ！ よいしょ！ よいしょ！ 降りる...
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Going down...

4736
03:26:09,328 --> 03:26:11,328
Yeah, let's go inside the blue stuff.

4737
03:26:11,528 --> 03:26:13,328
行けるかな？
Can we make it?

4738
03:26:13,528 --> 03:26:15,528
Oh no, blizzard here!
Oh no, a blizzard here!

4739
03:26:15,528 --> 03:26:17,328
寒いんじゃな〜い、のじゃ！
Isn't it cold?!

4740
03:26:17,328 --> 03:26:21,328
Ah! Ah! Ah!

4741
