...coconut. It's dark!

4751
03:26:48,328 --> 03:26:50,328
Okay, done.

4752
03:26:50,328 --> 03:26:52,828
It's dark, のじゃ！
It's dark!

4753
03:26:52,828 --> 03:26:54,328
That should be helpful.

4754
03:26:54,328 --> 03:26:57,328
よいしょ！ よいしょ！ よいしょ！ よいしょ！
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

4755
