4756
03:26:58,828 --> 03:27:02,328
Blue thing! あった！ The blue thing!
Blue thing! Found it! The blue thing!

4757
03:27:02,328 --> 03:27:04,328
Blue thingy? Nice! Yeah, the blue thing's here!

4758
03:27:04,328 --> 03:27:06,328
Yes, here! Oh, over there?

4759
03:27:06,828 --> 03:27:08,828
Let's go, let's go!

4760
03:27:08,828 --> 03:27:10,828
見つけた！ I found it!
I found it! I found it!

4761
03:27:11,328 --> 03:27:12,828
Nice, nice, nice.

4762
03:27:14,328 --> 03:27:15,828
よいしょ！ Need food?
Heave-ho! Need food?

4763
03:27:16,328 --> 03:27:18,328
Yeah, blue thing! Food, now.

4764
03:27:19,828 --> 03:27:23,328
Ah, well, I do have cooked coconut in my backpack if you want it.

4765
03:27:23,328 --> 03:27:25,828
I want coconut! That might help.

4766
03:27:26,328 --> 03:27:28,328
Yeah, grab coconut. Thank you!

4767
03:27:28,328 --> 03:27:30,328
Okay, nice.

4768
03:27:30,828 --> 03:27:33,328
Here's safe zone!
Here's a safe zone!

4769
03:27:33,328 --> 03:27:35,328
Maybe...

4770
03:27:36,828 --> 03:27:38,828
Wait, blizzard is in there.

4771
03:27:38,828 --> 03:27:41,828
のじゃ！ Yep. のじゃ！
Yep.

4772
03:27:41,828 --> 03:27:45,328
Got it! What's that? What is it? What is it?

4773
03:27:46,328 --> 03:27:48,328
I want coconut.

4774
03:27:48,828 --> 03:27:51,828
Initiative. What's initiative?

4775
03:27:51,828 --> 03:27:53,328
Initiative? Put it in the backpack.

4776
03:27:53,328 --> 03:27:55,328
Okay. のじゃ！
Okay.

4777
03:27:56,328 --> 03:28:00,328
Can we climb inside here? Maybe this is the way?

4778
03:28:00,328 --> 03:28:02,828
This way! Yeah, looks like it. Yeah, looks like we can climb.

4779
03:28:02,828 --> 03:28:05,828
Yeah, all the way up there. It's the flying one.

4780
03:28:05,828 --> 03:28:07,328
あった！
Found it!

4781
03:28:08,328 --> 03:28:10,328
Oh, it's the flying one. That should be helpful, too.

4782
