ピトン落ちてるよ、キョーコ。いいの？
There's a piton lying here, Kyoko. Is that okay?

4784
03:28:14,528 --> 03:28:17,328
え？ ピトン、ピトン欲しい！ ピトン欲しい！
Huh? A piton, I want the piton! I want the piton!

4785
03:28:17,328 --> 03:28:19,328
Not good. That piton is used already, yeah.

4786
03:28:21,828 --> 03:28:24,328
あ、使ったやつ。
Ah, it's a used one.

4787
