Help!

4788
03:28:26,128 --> 03:28:28,328
Biboo needs help!

4789
03:28:28,828 --> 03:28:34,828
よいしょ！ よいしょ！ よいしょ！ よいしょ！ よいしょ！ よいしょ！ よいしょ！
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

4790
03:28:34,828 --> 03:28:36,828
I need help! よいしょ！ のじゃ！
I need help! Heave-ho!

4791
03:28:37,328 --> 03:28:40,828
Thank you! Thank you! Thank you! のじゃ！
Thank you! Thank you! Thank you!

4792
03:28:40,828 --> 03:28:43,328
