Sorry...

4873
03:32:16,336 --> 03:32:17,936
いや、待って、恐いのじゃ。
No, wait, it's scary, noja.

4874
03:32:18,036 --> 03:32:19,736
いや、待って、恐い...
No, wait, it's scary...

4875
03:32:19,786 --> 03:32:23,836
Ah, I can't... I can't give her this. I can't give her this.

4876
03:32:24,336 --> 03:32:28,136
Rest in peace.

4877
