4894
03:33:20,836 --> 03:33:21,836
No.

4895
03:33:22,836 --> 03:33:24,336
I can't, maybe.

4896
03:33:25,336 --> 03:33:27,836
She's not waking up though!

4897
03:33:27,836 --> 03:33:28,836
No.

4898
03:33:30,136 --> 03:33:31,336
死滅かも。
Might be dead.

4899
03:33:31,336 --> 03:33:32,736
She's not waking up.

4900
03:33:32,836 --> 03:33:37,336
Maybe... Do you still have the cure-all with you?

4901
03:33:37,336 --> 03:33:39,136
Yes, but I can't feed her.

4902
03:33:39,336 --> 03:33:40,336
Oh, you can't?

4903
03:33:40,436 --> 03:33:41,336
I can't.

4904
03:33:42,336 --> 03:33:44,136
キョーコが使った方がいいかも。
Kyoko should probably use it.

4905
03:33:44,336 --> 03:33:47,336
Yeah, when she's fainted, I can't feed her.

4906
03:33:48,136 --> 03:33:52,336
Oh wait, can you drop that? Not throw, just drop it.

4907
03:33:52,336 --> 03:33:53,636
Please drop it.

4908
