I... I'm 半分くらい傷ついてる。
I... I'm about half damaged.

4918
03:34:24,836 --> 03:34:28,336
Do you have energy right now? Are you hungry? Are you hurt?

4919
03:34:28,336 --> 03:34:29,336
I'm hurt!

4920
03:34:29,336 --> 03:34:30,336
Yes.

4921
03:34:30,336 --> 03:34:32,236
Okay, okay. Wait.

4922
03:34:32,336 --> 03:34:34,836
あ！ ちょっと減った！ Little hurt.
Ah! It decreased a little! Little hurt.

4923
03:34:34,836 --> 03:34:35,836
Okay?

4924
03:34:35,836 --> 03:34:36,336
Yes.

4925
03:34:36,336 --> 03:34:37,836
A little hurt, okay.

4926
03:34:38,136 --> 03:34:40,336
あ！ 待っ、 サンキュー！
Ah! Wait, thank you!

4927
03:34:40,336 --> 03:34:43,336
Thank you for helping!

4928
03:34:43,336 --> 03:34:44,536
Okay, okay, okay.

4929
