I would've been fine dying just like this.

4930
03:34:47,336 --> 03:34:55,136
わしのこと置いてってくれても良かったのに、先輩が助けてくれた。Senpai helped me. Kyoko and Senpai helped me.
You could've left me behind, but Senpai saved me. Senpai helped me. Kyoko and Senpai helped me.

4931
