What?

4947
03:35:30,144 --> 03:35:31,544
Kyoko, are you okay?

4948
03:35:31,544 --> 03:35:32,744
Uh-huh.

4949
03:35:32,744 --> 03:35:34,544
Kyoko, are you okay?

4950
03:35:34,544 --> 03:35:36,144
