4967
03:36:11,144 --> 03:36:12,644
Yes, yes.

4968
03:36:14,544 --> 03:36:17,144
Okay, okay, okay, you can actually go here.

4969
03:36:17,144 --> 03:36:18,144
Okay!

4970
03:36:18,144 --> 03:36:19,144
Okay, let me try.

4971
03:36:19,144 --> 03:36:22,144
This side stuff, you can actually go this way.

4972
03:36:22,144 --> 03:36:23,544
Yes!

4973
