It's gonna grow directly!

4978
03:36:32,944 --> 03:36:34,144
なに？
What?

4979
03:36:34,344 --> 03:36:36,844
If you... If you want me to throw it...

4980
03:36:36,844 --> 03:36:38,544
No, it's gonna start growing already!

4981
