I will drop my bean. I also have a bean, hold on.

4983
03:36:47,144 --> 03:36:49,544
Wait, wait, I can chain launcher here.

4984
03:36:49,544 --> 03:36:51,144
いっぱい持ってる？
You have a lot?

4985
