4993
03:37:11,444 --> 03:37:14,144
Wait, wait, wait. Okay, wait, wait. Uh, be careful of this thing, okay?

4994
03:37:14,544 --> 03:37:17,544
Be careful of that thing.

4995
03:37:17,544 --> 03:37:18,344
Uh-huh.

4996
03:37:18,344 --> 03:37:19,844
That thing?

4997
03:37:19,844 --> 03:37:23,844
We don't really have like a lot of energy, but okay, wait.

4998
03:37:23,844 --> 03:37:25,544
どれがあぶない？
Which one is dangerous?

4999
